WEBVTT

00:00.680 --> 00:03.960
What does openness mean to you?

00:07.160 --> 00:09.920
To us, it's an expression of inclusion,

00:10.120 --> 00:13.200
innovation, and possibility.

00:14.640 --> 00:17.680
It's a gateway to a world of endless potential

00:17.920 --> 00:22.080
fueled by a vibrant 24-hour economy.

00:23.760 --> 00:27.760
It's your passport to a land rich in natural resources,

00:28.080 --> 00:31.960
where green fields bloom into golden opportunities.

00:31.960 --> 00:43.680
[music]

00:43.680 --> 00:47.360
Openness is a fertile ground where industries thrive,

00:47.480 --> 00:51.360
backed by technology and a big push by government.

00:52.560 --> 00:55.760
It's a strategic point to access Africa's rising market

00:55.840 --> 00:57.680
of over 1 billion people.

00:58.280 --> 01:03.160
And from here, every major global market is within reach.

01:03.160 --> 01:06.080
[music]

01:06.080 --> 01:08.880
Openness is an experience at the center of the world,

01:08.960 --> 01:10.880
where the Black Star shines.

01:11.480 --> 01:13.680
It's the rich spirit of our people,

01:13.880 --> 01:15.800
our open minds, welcoming hearts,

01:15.880 --> 01:18.680
and the deep pride in our African heritage.

01:19.400 --> 01:21.040
Openness is Ghana.

01:21.680 --> 01:23.720
A nation ready to trade,

01:24.080 --> 01:26.720
to innovate, to lead.

01:27.080 --> 01:31.280
It's our invitation to you for business, pleasure, and investment.

01:32.480 --> 01:36.000
Ghana is open for business.

01:36.000 --> 01:40.202
[music]
